Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:11.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of deception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:01.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:04.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:11.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:22.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll stop by on my way home and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you know what size to get?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:47.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, the pull-up type in size L, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:48.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!\NYeah, the pull-up type in size L, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:48.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, the pull-up type in size L, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.76,0:01:49.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, that's Dad right?\NYeah, the pull-up type in size L, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:50.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, that's Dad right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:51.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah. Okay, thanks again.\NMom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:53.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah. Okay, thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you run from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:39.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's with those eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:43.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:50.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Drop the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.79,0:02:59.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I turned off my pain perception, so it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:50.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you want me to kill you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:55.53,Dialogue,,500,0,500,,{\b1}One \N Angry \N Man{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:55.53,Sign,,0,1000,850,, {\fs52}{\b1\i1}Note: This title is a nod to \N the courtroom drama 12 Angry Men{\b1}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:04:00.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The total number of shots fired was twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.68,0:04:02.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:04.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.25,0:04:10.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It looks like your detention\Nis going to last a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:15.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am Public Safety Section 9's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:19.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:23.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, there is now a possibility\Nthat there will be a summary proceeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:31.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:35.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have been retained by your parents as your attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My name is Ueda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:37.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:40.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can you get me a new cybernetic body soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:43.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no pain, but this is intolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:44.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:46.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You'll be out within two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:51.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, it must really be painful to\Nhave suffered so many gunshot wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:54.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Weren't your actions actually accidental?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:55.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:59.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your cybernetic parts... you've\Nmodified them many times, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:01.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:05.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems you've combined\Nparts from different manufacturers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:08.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and you've overwritten the\Nregulatory software every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:14.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am an attorney who specialises\Nin cases involving cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:17.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am therefore well-versed in these circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:22.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is entirely possible that your\Nregulatory mechanisms could go haywire
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,for no reason, even under normal circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:30.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Indictment. We request an indictment of the accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:32.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,September 9th, 2032.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:37.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prosecuting Attorney of the Niihama\NDistrict Public Prosecutors Office, Mori Kazuomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:41.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To the Niihama District Court.\NLegal domicile: Niihama Prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:44.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Address: Niihama City, Sumiyoshi-dai 2-B-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:47.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unemployed, Izumi Kazuhiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:50.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,DOB: June 18th, 2009.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Charges against the defendant:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:58.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The defendant repeatedly pressed Shizuno Yukari,\Nhis former girlfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:06:02.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,then age 24 and a nurse at Niihama\NCity Hospital, to reconcile, and was refused...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:08.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're being detained, even\Nthough you're not the perpetrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I feel the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:12.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it's in order to expedite the trial's completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, even though it was to save a life,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it is true that I used my gun off-duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:20.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you're required to carry a gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you can quit your current job with the security company!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How is a family of four going to keep\Nthemselves fed if I quit my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:29.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, thanks for coming all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't care about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your course of action also deserves some recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, the problem lies in the fact\Nthat you fired shots while off-duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:07:06.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The accused's old man is a CEO of a large company. The bastard who's defending him is a notorious yame-ken \N who rakes in big bucks by taking on cyborg-related cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:06.30,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Note: Yame-ken are state prosecutors who have quit to become defence lawyers{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:09.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll prepare myself for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:16.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What we say in meetings while you're still\Nisolated may be used in cross-examinations,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:19.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so I'll let you decide what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:20.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:22.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,More importantly, about my wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You don't need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I told her she's better off going\Nhome because she'd be sickened
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,if she were to observe the court proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:30.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:32.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One last thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure you're aware of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:39.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but all transmissions are prohibited in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:42.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If there is a transmission on normal frequencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:44.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it'll get traced back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prepare your testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:54.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:56.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In your testimony,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:08:03.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,you said that you tried to immobilise Mr Izumi\Nby focusing your shots on his shoulders and legs,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:06.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but why was it necessary to fire that many shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:11.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The accused had cybernetic implants\Nand he said that he had cut pain perception,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:14.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so I felt the need to completely immobilise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:15.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.82,0:08:20.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I recall correctly, you said that you first\Nimmobilised the perpetrator, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:24.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, the perpetrator did not let go of the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is an ironclad rule to take away weapons\Nfrom the perpetrator during an ongoing arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:33.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well then, let us try and look at\Nthings from a different perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:39.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Togusa. Does this seem familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:43.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes. It is the same model as the\Nweapon I carry while I'm on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:45.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:48.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is a replica of Mateba's automatic revolver,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:52.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but does everyone use this at your workplace?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My coworkers all use Seburo M-5's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:09:04.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seburo M-5 is an automatic that can fire off a\Nmaximum of twenty-one 5.7mm rounds, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, your model only allows you to fire six rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:10.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't you think that is too inefficient?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:16.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Togusa, what happens when you\Nexhaust your rounds with this model?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:19.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I discard the casings and reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:24.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I would like to hear an explanation since I\Nam not very knowledgeable about firearms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:30.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Which allows you to reload\Nfaster, the automatic or the revolver?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:31.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It depends...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.45,0:09:35.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it'd be the automatic under most circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:38.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, the revolver has its merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Excuse me for interrupting, Mr. Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:43.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You only need to answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then let me ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:50.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Which allows you to load\Nfaster, the Seburo or the Mateba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Seburo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:53.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:59.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So you deliberately choose to\Nuse an inefficient model on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:04.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't this extremely strange,\Nconsidering the nature of your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.32,0:10:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is that aspect to the model, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But unlike automatics, revolvers won't jam,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:15.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and six rounds suffice unless the\Ncircumstances are extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.32,0:10:19.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is not very persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:21.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, you did in fact\Nencounter an extreme circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To be blunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:28.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,aren't you choosing to carry a\Nrevolver based on personal preference?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:30.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:36.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is not due to... personal preference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:45.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,According to the report, you spend\Nquite a lot of time in target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:51.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't you seeking personal\Nfulfilment in shooting firearms as a hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:58.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Whether or not Mr. Togusa's target practice is a personal\Nhobby is speculation on the part of the defending counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:00.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is no factual basis behind their assertions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Objection sustained.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:09.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Defending counsel should ask\Nquestions that pertain directly to the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:11.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood, your Honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:15.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, Mr. Togusa, I'd like to confirm this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:22.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you remember what you said...\Nwhen you shot Mr. Izumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:27.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you do not, allow me to refresh your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:32.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You yelled, "Do you want to be killed?!" to Mr. Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:35.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Among the courses of action you were considering,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:39.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there was the possibility that you\Nwere going to kill the defendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:40.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:41.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's taken completely out of context!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:47.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Witness, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.63,0:11:50.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is a fact that the defendant was\Nshot in all four limbs by the witness...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}This is ridiculous.{\i}\NIt is a fact that the defendant was\Nshot in all four limbs by the witness...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}This is ridiculous.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:54.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I did shoot the defendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but only to save the victim!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:00.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems you feel no regret for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:02.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't change the subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The issue is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Togusa, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But, your Honour...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:08.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:20.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How are things going? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:25.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That lawyer is surprisingly skilled, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But it's not like Togusa is the defendant...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:33.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seemed like that was how the trial\Nwas going before court was adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:37.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about encrypted transmissions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:38.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:40.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's in autistic mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:44.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess he didn't get the hint during our meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:47.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Togusa is naive, but he's not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.03,0:12:50.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He understood that we would be sending\Nencrypted transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:54.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So he doesn't want to use underhanded methods in court?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:56.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:59.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He stopped looking our way during the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm going to try checking the defendant's background.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:06.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, continue to observe the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:09.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am returning to HQ for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:10.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:14.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I believe that Mr. Togusa had an intent to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.63,0:13:19.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your Honour, Mr. Togusa said this in his statement:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.33,0:13:24.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Upon encountering the accused, I could tell\Nright away that he was a complete cyborg."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:30.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,His statement infringes on the Cyborg\NAnti-Discrimination Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:38.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Consequently, I believe that his relentless firing upon\Nthe defendant was due to his bias against cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:39.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:45.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Your Honour, the Cyborg\NAnti-Discrimination Law is irrelevant to this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Objection Sustained.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:52.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Defending counsel should\Nbase its assertions on specific facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.62,0:13:53.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood, your Honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:59.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd now like to allude to Mr. Togusa's\Nspeciality, the workplace environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,before proceeding to explain his specific actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Public Safety Section 9, where Mr. Togusa works,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:10.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is a special organisation that consists solely of\Nmembers who all have augmented cybernetic bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Having been subjected to prolonged stress in a\Nwork environment where he is surrounded by cyborgs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:24.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we posit that he has developed a\Nsubconscious inferiority complex and bias against them
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:29.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and that my client gave him an\Noutlet for his negative feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:34.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That statement was also a baseless\Nspeculation by the defending counsel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:37.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Objection sustained.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:46.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, I found something\Ninteresting in the defendant's terminal:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:50.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,certified proof of the illegal cybernetic\Nbody he'd had fitted the day before the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:52.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you think we can get him with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:55.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Looks like we might have a reason to believe we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:15:00.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pass the information Batou found to the prosecution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:01.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.87,0:15:08.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, what about the information we received that this\Nprosecutor, Kusunoki, is trying to drag Section 9 into court?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:13.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was the one who acted when\NSecretary General Yakushima was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.27,0:15:17.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems he is pulling the strings in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.87,0:15:18.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:25.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It means someone has set Kusunoki's ambition\Non fire after he obtained information on Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:27.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It must be Gouda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:29.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How clever of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:36.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mom, when will Dad come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:41.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hmm... I wonder when.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:44.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am considering bringing civil charges against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.29,0:15:51.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:56.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I just contacted your superior officer, Chief Aramaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:15:59.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As I'd expected, he was a very reasonable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:02.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It looks like we can settle this case as an accident\Nresulting from a malfunction in the prosthetic body's control system
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:06.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in return for dropping the civil charges against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:08.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There is no way the Chief would accept a deal like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:13.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then I will proceed as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:16.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure it'll be Section 9\Nmembers who'll suffer because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't care either way, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:32.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Togusa, would you have fired as many shots
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:34.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,had the perpetrator been flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course I would've dealt with the matter differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:38.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:40.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then I will ask you about the specific actions of Section 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:45.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the organisation you're affiliated with, in recent incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:51.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Suicide-bombing terrorism by cyborg\Nrefugees has been occurring frequently, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:57.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've heard that Section 9 has been\Nvery closely involved with these cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:58.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:16:59.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:07.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is it also true that you were directly involved in the arrest\Nof a perpetrator in the recent serial suicide bombing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:08.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:14.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Enforce a media blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:16.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm already on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:21.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here is a copy of the case report\Nthat was submitted to the prosecution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:27.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,According to the report,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:30.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,while preventing the cyborg refugee's suicide bombing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:35.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Togusa gave a warning and, moreover, held his fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:43.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why was there such a large difference between the way you\Ndealt with the defendant and with the suicide bomber girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:47.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is clearly proof that there was a bias.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:52.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I gave a warning to the defendant in this case as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:56.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, the actions he took were\Nentirely different in nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I just tried to save the victim, who was calling for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That may be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:06.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, there is no way to prove that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:11.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We do not wish to judge you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:16.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We merely wish to prove that this case was an\Naccident that was brought about by your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:20.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In fact, Mr. Izumi had been subjected to baseless suspicion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:25.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,after the serial suicide bombing\Nattacks, due to his cybernetic implants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:27.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is why, only a day before the incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:32.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he'd had a new prosthetic arm fitted that made\Nclear at a glance that he was no refugee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:34.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So that's how they'll go about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:41.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Court is temporarily adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:51.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:57.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The victim cannot rest in peace with such a fake trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yesterday, the defendant's lawyer met with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and using civil charges as a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.52,0:19:05.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,pressured me to settle the case as an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:08.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You probably intend to make me back down
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.09,0:19:13.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,by using the fact that my work involves\Nspecial missions in the cross examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:16.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, I will no longer be intimidated by such threats,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:20.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,for I am going to resign from Section 9 here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:25.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.49,0:19:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Letting his anger get the better of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.39,0:19:32.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This case was no accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:36.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, it is true that I could not save the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:39.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you want to press civil charges against me, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:44.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But in return, I won't run away from this trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Witness, the court is currently adjourned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:51.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Resume giving your statement after we are in session.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:52.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.99,0:19:54.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want to say at least this:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems that this type of trial has recently been on the rise
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:20:00.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in parallel to the increased prevalence of cyborgs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:05.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I've heard that there are instances\Nin which a particular cyborg manufacturer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:07.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,colludes with the prosecution or the defence
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.99,0:20:10.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and conducts unfair trials in order\Nto cover up their products' flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:16.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Due to the nature of my work, I have become\Nknowledgeable about such underhanded dealings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now that I have firmed my resolve to resign from Section 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.69,0:20:20.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I intend to reveal all of the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.39,0:20:23.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so you guys better be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Remove the witness from court.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:43.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A late return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:50.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I am not very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though it's you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:54.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to think that you ghost hacked\Nme without permission...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:55.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have problems with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.28,0:20:59.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's because you were brandishing that naive\Nrighteousness of yours in a meaningless manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:02.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But... what happened then had the opposite effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After that, the defendant got a tentatively guilty verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:11.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He'll probably get the same verdict in the actual trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:15.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the Major made you say back there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:19.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is information we found after\Ninvestigating the lawyer's bank account.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:24.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He feared that his own secrets would become exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:31.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Furthermore, Prosecutor Kusunoki, who was plotting\Nto take advantage of this case and extort Section 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:35.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,decided to withdraw before his\Nties with the lawyer became clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prosecutor Kusunoki? You mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:38.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The scriptwriter was probably Gouda\Nfrom the Cabinet Intelligence Agency,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:43.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the director was Kusunoki,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:45.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the lead was that yame-ken lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:47.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:50.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where'd the whole concept\Nof fighting for justice in court go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:55.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Unfortunately, the justice you believe in\Nmay no longer have any role to play in this trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:21:59.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But the victim's spirit won't be able to rest in peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There may be divine retribution, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Divine retribution?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:14.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}Next: According to a report that just came in,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}the accused and the lawyer in the homicide case of a nurse,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:21.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}which was high-profile due to potential\Nimplications regarding the Cyborg Anti-Discrimination Law...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:23.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Scrap this car please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:24.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}...were in a car accident.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:26.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Toss out all the paperwork, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:28.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,800,,{\i1}The lawyer died as a result of the accident, while the\Ndefendant's cybernetic body suffered critical damage.{\i}
